# Temple of Power counts noncombat damage only. Bot1 cast Ojer Axonil on turn 1 (Mox Ruby, Mountain, Mox Pearl, Mox Jet); Bot2 cast Ornithopter and killed it on
# turn 2 with two Lightning Bolts, and it came back tapped and transformed as Temple of Power (CR 712.14a). Bot1 casts Fervent Champion (red, haste) on turn 3.
# Turn 5: Lightning Bolt deals 3 to Bot2 and the Champion attacks for 1 combat damage: 4 red damage, but 3 of it noncombat,
# so in the second main phase the Temple is refused. Firebolt's 2 at Bot2 makes 5 noncombat and it transforms.

